      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CASH ON DEMAND (8) box seated before sticking on well to finish 3.5 lengths away in second (21.97) at this track in a Mix 5 over 390m. Can measure up this time. CLEAN ENGINES (6) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when fifth (19.98) in a Mix 5 at Capalaba. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. ART OF DECEPTION (4) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 19.88 beating Zippity Zeal. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Leading chance again. CHEAP PERFUME (3) can run a bold race on best form.",
